! Megh.ascl
!
Megh in A# - Nadi (just intonation). Monsoon pentatonic: Sa, Re, Ma, Pa, komal Ni. No third, so it leans neither major nor minor.
!
 5
!
 9/8
 4/3
 3/2
 9/5
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   Re    203.91 cents
!   Ma    498.04 cents
!   Pa    701.96 cents
!   ni   1017.60 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
! Sattvagenic - sattvagenic.com/nadi
!
! @ABL NOTE_NAMES "Sa" "Re" "Ma" "Pa" "ni"
! @ABL REFERENCE_PITCH 3 0 466.163761
! @ABL SOURCE sattvagenic.com/nadi
